create folder hello-app => create 2 files main.py and app.yaml

main.py =>
from flask import Flask

app = Flask(__name__)

@app.route('/')
def hello():
    return "Hello World from Google App Engine"

if __name__ == '__main__':
    app.run(host='127.0.0.1', port=8080, debug=True)


app.yaml =>
runtime: python39


on terminal =>
gcloud init
python main.py
